Extend allowed syntax for system, partition and environment names (and features):
names may now start with a digit and may contain '.' and '+' (e.g. 'g++', 'gcc-11.2+omp').
Also allows '=' in the value of '%key=value' specs, and validates resource/extras key names.
Backport of https://github.com/reframe-hpc/reframe/pull/3725 (commit 7f15777) to ReFrame 4.10.2;
rebased onto v4.10.2 (only line offsets differ from the upstream commit).
author: Caspar van Leeuwen (SURF)
